# Allow the install scripts this repo actually needs.
#
# esbuild (used by Vite + tsx) requires its postinstall to fetch the platform
# binary — without it the build and dev server cannot run.
#
# core-js and tesseract.js only print promotional messages, but they are
# listed so `npm install` runs cleanly with no warnings.
#
# Older npm versions ignore this key entirely and simply run all scripts,
# so this file is safe everywhere.
allow-scripts[]=esbuild
allow-scripts[]=core-js
allow-scripts[]=tesseract.js
